  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xE9;sultats atteints</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xE9;sultats atteints</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Parmi les r&#xE9;sultats obtenus jusqu&apos;en mars 2021 : 1) int&#xE9;gr&#xE9; 8 personnalisations dans la plateforme BlueDot Insight pour r&#xE9;pondre aux besoins de l&apos;Organisation Internationale de Police Criminelle (INTERPOL); 2) form&#xE9; 5 analystes d&apos;INTERPOL et fourni un acc&#xE8;s &#xE0; la plateforme BlueDot; 3) produit et soumis 25 rapports d&apos;&#xE9;valuation des menaces &#xE0; INTERPOL, qui a d&#xE9;termin&#xE9; que la plateforme BlueDot pouvait &#xEA;tre adapt&#xE9;e aux besoins des forces de l&apos;ordre.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved as of March 2021  include: (1) integrated 8 customizations into the BlueDot Insight platform to fit the International Criminal Police Organization&#x2019;s (INTERPOL) needs; (2) trained 5 INTERPOL analysts and provided access to the BlueDot platform; and (3) produced and submitted 25 threat assessment reports to INTERPOL, which determined that the BlueDot platform could be adapted for law enforcement needs.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xE9;sultats escompt&#xE9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xE9;sultats escompt&#xE9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xE9;sultats escompt&#xE9;s de ce projet comprennent : 1) sensibiliser davantage INTERPOL aux menaces biologiques locales, r&#xE9;gionales et mondiales; 2) renforcer la capacit&#xE9; des organismes d&#x2019;application de la loi &#xE0; effectuer des interventions visant &#xE0; contrer les r&#xE9;percussions des menaces biologiques; 3) sensibiliser davantage INTERPOL aux r&#xE9;percussions mondiales des menaces chimiques, biologiques, radiologiques et nucl&#xE9;aires pour la s&#xE9;curit&#xE9;.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes of this project include: (1) enhanced awareness by INTERPOL of local, regional and global biological threats; (2) strengthened capacity of law enforcement agencies to target interventions to counter the impacts of biological threats; and (3) enhanced awareness by INTERPOL of the international impact of chemical, biological, radiological and nuclear security threats.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
